WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.369 --> 00:00:16.334
It is not easy to pull a boat across the ocean.

2
00:00:17.234 --> 00:00:19.955
After a few hours, the birds got tired.

3
00:00:19.975 --> 00:00:22.937
Up ahead was a small island.

4
00:00:22.957 --> 00:00:27.799
"We must rest for a while," they said to the doctor.

5
00:00:28.559 --> 00:00:30.600
So they pulled the boat to the island.

6
00:00:32.252 --> 00:00:34.213
The island was very beautiful.

7
00:00:34.793 --> 00:00:38.274
There were many high mountains and colorful flowers.

8
00:00:38.294 --> 00:00:41.475
"What a lovely place!"

9
00:00:42.195 --> 00:00:44.555
Dr. Dolittle said as he admired the view.

10
00:00:44.575 --> 00:00:46.116
"WOOF! ARF!

11
00:00:46.576 --> 00:00:49.697
ARF!" Jip started to bark loudly.

12
00:00:50.517 --> 00:00:52.978
Dr. Dolittle turned around to see why.

13
00:00:54.178 --> 00:00:56.559
A lot of rats were coming off the boat.

14
00:00:57.199 --> 00:00:58.759
Jip was running around them.

15
00:00:58.779 --> 00:01:02.916
"Chasing rats is my favorite game," he barked.

16
00:01:03.776 --> 00:01:04.717
"Stop it, Jip!"

17
00:01:05.157 --> 00:01:06.337
the doctor called out.

18
00:01:07.017 --> 00:01:09.178
The rats were afraid of the big dog.

19
00:01:10.838 --> 00:01:14.699
One big black rat carefully crawled over to the doctor.

20
00:01:15.660 --> 00:01:17.920
He was scared that Jip might chase him.

21
00:01:17.940 --> 00:01:22.862
"Excuse me, Doctor," the rat said in a soft voice.

22
00:01:22.882 --> 00:01:25.262
"Dr. Dolittle!

23
00:01:25.622 --> 00:01:29.243
Someone wants to speak with you," a bird called out.

24
00:01:29.263 --> 00:01:31.324
"Oh, hello.

25
00:01:32.088 --> 00:01:33.289
What's going on?"

26
00:01:33.830 --> 00:01:35.230
the kind doctor asked.

27
00:01:36.852 --> 00:01:38.993
The rat wiped his mouth and whiskers.

28
00:01:39.013 --> 00:01:42.656
"All ships have rats," he said.

29
00:01:42.676 --> 00:01:48.800
"And rats never stay on sinking ships," the rat kept one eye on Jip.

30
00:01:48.820 --> 00:01:51.141
"Yes. JIP!

31
00:01:51.562 --> 00:01:54.123
Stop chasing those rats!"

32
00:01:54.183 --> 00:01:55.364
Dr. Dolittle shouted.

33
00:01:55.384 --> 00:02:00.388
"And rats are always right," the rat wiped his mouth again.

34
00:02:01.596 --> 00:02:02.657
"Oh, do hurry up!

35
00:02:02.977 --> 00:02:04.458
What is it you want to say?"

36
00:02:05.219 --> 00:02:06.239
Dab-Dab snapped.

37
00:02:06.259 --> 00:02:11.243
"Your boat is sinking," the rat spoke quickly.

38
00:02:11.263 --> 00:02:13.104
"How do you know?"

39
00:02:13.645 --> 00:02:14.445
asked the doctor.

40
00:02:14.465 --> 00:02:18.988
"Rats have a special sense," the rat said, waving his tail.

41
00:02:19.008 --> 00:02:20.570
"Don't get on your boat!

42
00:02:20.930 --> 00:02:24.933
IT WILL SINK!"

43
00:02:25.013 --> 00:02:26.914
Dr. Dolittle went to look for water.

44
00:02:26.934 --> 00:02:29.476
"Do you believe that rat?"

45
00:02:30.192 --> 00:02:31.032
asked Dab-Dab.

46
00:02:31.052 --> 00:02:33.833
"Yes. Why would he lie?"

47
00:02:34.373 --> 00:02:35.494
the doctor replied.

48
00:02:35.514 --> 00:02:40.335
"Because all rats lie," the duck said with a frown.

49
00:02:41.516 --> 00:02:42.076
But Dr.

50
00:02:42.116 --> 00:02:43.456
Dolittle believed the rat.

51
00:02:43.956 --> 00:02:46.717
He and the animals would have to stay on the island now.

52
00:02:47.337 --> 00:02:49.298
So he went to look for food and water.

53
00:02:49.318 --> 00:02:51.779
"Just look, Dab-Dab!"

54
00:02:52.399 --> 00:02:55.100
Dr. Dolittle pointed to a beautiful lake.

55
00:02:57.372 --> 00:03:00.935
Dr. Dolittle and the animals had plenty to drink and eat.

56
00:03:00.955 --> 00:03:03.516
"Look! Bananas!"

57
00:03:04.077 --> 00:03:05.878
Gub-Gub shoved one in his mouth.

58
00:03:05.898 --> 00:03:11.082
"I love green grass," the pushmi-pullyu said happily.

59
00:03:11.102 --> 00:03:16.426
"I noticed," the duck said, "that only one of you eats."

60
00:03:16.446 --> 00:03:21.409
"Yes, one eats while the other talks," smiled the pushmi-pullyu.

61
00:03:22.970 --> 00:03:25.392
A little later, they all lay down to rest.

62
00:03:26.452 --> 00:03:28.614
"What are we going to do about the boat?"

63
00:03:29.134 --> 00:03:29.735
Jip asked.

64
00:03:30.656 --> 00:03:32.497
"I don't know," Dr.

65
00:03:32.517 --> 00:03:33.578
Dolittle replied.

66
00:03:33.598 --> 00:03:39.503
"If the rats are right, then we won't be able to continue," the dog worried.

67
00:03:40.704 --> 00:03:43.566
At that moment, two birds flew toward them.

68
00:03:43.586 --> 00:03:45.427
"Dr. Dolittle!

69
00:03:45.788 --> 00:03:46.769
Dr. Dolittle!"

70
00:03:47.409 --> 00:03:48.010
cried one.

71
00:03:48.030 --> 00:03:49.691
"What is it?"

72
00:03:50.231 --> 00:03:51.192
the doctor asked.

73
00:03:51.212 --> 00:03:53.714
"Pirates! On the island!"

74
00:03:54.555 --> 00:03:55.636
gasped the other bird.

75
00:03:57.564 --> 00:03:59.905
The Barbary pirates were on the island.

76
00:03:59.925 --> 00:04:01.426
"Don't worry!

77
00:04:01.666 --> 00:04:02.266
Come with us!

78
00:04:02.546 --> 00:04:04.887
We'll help you escape," said one bird.

79
00:04:04.907 --> 00:04:06.308
"But how?"

80
00:04:06.948 --> 00:04:07.548
asked Dr.

81
00:04:07.588 --> 00:04:10.649
Dolittle. "You must take the pirates' ship.

82
00:04:10.989 --> 00:04:12.830
It's very big and fast!"

83
00:04:16.472 --> 00:04:18.192
There was no one on the ship.

84
00:04:18.212 --> 00:04:20.413
"Hurry! Hurry!"

85
00:04:20.933 --> 00:04:21.854
whispered the birds.

86
00:04:22.414 --> 00:04:24.555
Dr. Dolittle quickly got on the ship.

87
00:04:25.495 --> 00:04:27.076
The animals followed quietly.

88
00:04:27.724 --> 00:04:31.168
But then Gub-Gub dropped some of his bananas into the water.

89
00:04:31.628 --> 00:04:34.932
SPLASH! "Stop!

90
00:04:35.433 --> 00:04:36.554
Stop right there!"

91
00:04:37.215 --> 00:04:40.318
yelled the Barbary pirates as they ran out from the trees.
